   555	      N=2: k=2..6  D=6,9,12,15,18   T=3,4,7,8,11    Z·K_X = -2,-2,0,0,+2
   556	      N=3: k=2..6  D=8,12,16,20,24  T=5,8,9,14,17   Z·K_X = -1,+1,+1,+5,+7
   557	```
